            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Each component version needs a start page. This page can either be the default start page or a page identified by the component version descriptor. Visitors land on a component version’s start page when they click on its entry in the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "component version selector"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "navigation:index.html#component-dropdown"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " and when they click on its name at the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "top of the page menu"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "navigation:index.html#component-menu"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The start page for a component version is separate from the start page for a site. The start page for a site is where the visitor is directed when they go to the site’s main URL. To configure your site’s start page, see "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "playbook:site-start-page.html"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "playbook:site-start-page.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "By default, Antora looks for a "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page named "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "index.adoc"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "emphasis",
                    "roles": []
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "page:start-page.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " in the ROOT module of a component version and uses it as the component version’s start page (e.g., "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "https://site-url.org/component-name/version/index.html"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "). If Antora doesn’t find this page, visitors are directed to a 404 page every time they click on the component version from the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "component version selector"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "navigation:index.html#component-dropdown"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " or "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "page menu"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "navigation:index.html#component-menu"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If you set the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "start_page key"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "#start-page-key"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " in the component version’s "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "antora.yml"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", Antora will use that page as the start page instead of the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "index.adoc"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "emphasis",
                "roles": [
                  "path"
                ]
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " page in the ROOT module. You only have the set the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "start_page"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " key if you want to use an alternate page than the default as the start page."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "default-start-page",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
